+# ColorTokensKit dependency
+
+ColorTokensKit-Swift 0.3.0, upstream revision
+`cba1f4c857412f9f241efce4ce79302c487710f2`, is included as source under
+`ColorTokensKit-Swift`. Its MIT license is retained.
+
+The only runtime adaptation is resource loading. Packaged macOS apps load
+`ColorTokensKit_ColorTokensKit.bundle` from `Contents/Resources`, allowing
+strict code signing and operation without a developer build directory.
+SwiftPM test executables continue to use `Bundle.module`.
+
+This is the same adaptation already used by Arcium. No palette generation
+or color data has been changed. Update this source deliberately when upgrading
+the existing dependency.
